</section>
<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>IndusCP Benchmark Construction Details</h2>

<figure id="A6.T8" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>Summary of problem sources for the IndusCP benchmark. We collected problems from well-established academic and competitive programming platforms.</figcaption>
<table id="A6.T8.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A6.T8.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A6.T8.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="A6.T8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Source Category</span></th>
<th id="A6.T8.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="A6.T8.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"># Problems</span></th>
